- Graph fix: inserted `Normalize Ribbon Point Scale` (`PCGTransformPointsSettings`) immediately after `Sample Source Spline Ribbon Area Points`. It preserves sampled locations/rotations, sets point scale to `(1,1,1)`, and only then feeds `Distance To Source Spline` and the spawn branches.
