- Live watcher fix: graph reassignment plus one deferred generate could still leave stale point count after the scale-normalized graph rebuild. The watcher now performs two deferred generate passes after graph reassignment. Automatic 3-point shrink and 6-point expansion both passed with `last_error=null`.
